# Make a Windows complete copy, that can be deployed easily

- Configure SSH client
- Configure Acrylic DNS (make a tutorial)
- Install necessary programs

## Programs

In C:\Programs

1. JetBrains Suite (PyCharm, WebStorm, IDEA)
2. Adobe alternatives (Figma, GIMP, InkScape, others)
3. Environments (NodeJS, Python, Java, VS Code, Firefox)
4. Obsidian, Paint3D, Scratch, Пиктомир and others for Primary
5. Music and Sound compositing
6. Game development (Godot)
7. Microsoft Office
8. Notion, Project and task management
