## Administration

Create two accounts, one for student, which can be configured at the deployment.

In C:\Control add powershell and .bat scripts for controlling the computer, setting policies and Registry Keys. Also add there autorun sysinternals, and some other programs for diagnose and management perhaps.

Configure wallpapers to be numbers for the computer, maybe they can change based on the event. The number can be personalized with Figma assistance.

